# 🌾 Farm Machine Rental API

A production-grade RESTful API for a farm machine rental platform with JWT auth, RBAC, dynamic pricing, conflict detection, and ML integration.

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies
npm install

# 2. Configure environment
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your MongoDB URI and secrets

# 3. Seed database (optional)
npm run seed

# 4. Start development server
npm run dev

# 5. Start production server
npm start
```

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```
src/
├── config/
│   └── database.js          # MongoDB connection
├── controllers/
│   ├── authController.js    # Auth & token management
│   ├── machineController.js # Machine CRUD + availability
│   ├── bookingController.js # Full booking workflow
│   ├── paymentController.js # Payment processing
│   ├── adminController.js   # Admin control panel
│   └── mlController.js      # ML/AI integration APIs
├── middleware/
│   ├── auth.js              # JWT + RBAC middleware
│   ├── validation.js        # express-validator rules
│   ├── errorHandler.js      # Global error handler
│   └── logger.js            # Activity logging
├── models/
│   ├── User.js              # Users (Farmer/Owner/Admin)
│   ├── Machine.js           # Machine listings + availability
│   ├── Booking.js           # Bookings with workflow states
│   ├── Payment.js           # Payment records
│   └── Log.js               # Audit logs
├── routes/
│   ├── auth.js
│   ├── machines.js
│   ├── bookings.js
│   ├── payments.js
│   ├── admin.js
│   └── ml.js
├── services/
│   ├── pricingEngine.js     # Dynamic pricing calculator
│   └── availabilityService.js # Conflict detection
└── utils/
    ├── helpers.js           # JWT, pagination, distance utils
    ├── logger.js            # Winston daily-rotate logger
    ├── cronJobs.js          # Background automation tasks
    └── seeder.js            # Test data seeder
```

---

## 👥 Roles & Permissions (RBAC)

| Action                  | Farmer | Owner | Admin |
|------------------------|--------|-------|-------|
| Register / Login        | ✅     | ✅    | ✅    |
| Browse machines         | ✅     | ✅    | ✅    |
| Create booking          | ✅     | ❌    | ✅    |
| Approve/reject booking  | ❌     | ✅    | ✅    |
| Create machine listing  | ❌     | ✅    | ✅    |
| Approve machine listing | ❌     | ❌    | ✅    |
| Process refund          | ❌     | ❌    | ✅    |
| View analytics          | ❌     | ❌    | ✅    |
| ML demand prediction    | ❌     | ✅    | ✅    |
| ML recommendations      | ✅     | ❌    | ✅    |
| View audit logs         | ❌     | ❌    | ✅    |

---

## 📡 API Endpoints

### Auth — `/api/v1/auth`
| Method | Endpoint              | Access  | Description             |
|--------|-----------------------|---------|-------------------------|
| POST   | `/register`           | Public  | Register user           |
| POST   | `/login`              | Public  | Login + get JWT tokens  |
| POST   | `/refresh-token`      | Public  | Refresh access token    |
| POST   | `/logout`             | Private | Invalidate refresh token|
| GET    | `/me`                 | Private | Get current user        |
| PUT    | `/change-password`    | Private | Change password         |

### Machines — `/api/v1/machines`
| Method | Endpoint                      | Access       | Description                     |
|--------|-------------------------------|--------------|----------------------------------|
| GET    | `/`                           | Public       | List machines (filters + geo)    |
| POST   | `/`                           | Owner        | Create machine listing           |
| GET    | `/:id`                        | Public       | Get machine details              |
| PUT    | `/:id`                        | Owner/Admin  | Update machine                   |
| DELETE | `/:id`                        | Owner/Admin  | Soft delete machine              |
| GET    | `/:id/availability`           | Public       | Get availability calendar        |
| POST   | `/:id/price-estimate`         | Farmer       | Calculate booking price          |
| PATCH  | `/:id/approve`                | Admin        | Approve/reject listing           |
| POST   | `/:id/block-dates`            | Owner/Admin  | Block dates for maintenance      |

### Bookings — `/api/v1/bookings`
| Method | Endpoint              | Access       | Description                     |
|--------|-----------------------|--------------|----------------------------------|
| POST   | `/`                   | Farmer       | Create booking (conflict check)  |
| GET    | `/`                   | Private      | List bookings (by role)          |
| GET    | `/:id`                | Involved     | Get booking details              |
| PATCH  | `/:id/review`         | Owner/Admin  | Approve or reject booking        |
| PATCH  | `/:id/cancel`         | Farmer/Admin | Cancel booking                   |
| PATCH  | `/:id/activate`       | Owner/Admin  | Mark booking as started          |
| PATCH  | `/:id/complete`       | Owner/Admin  | Mark booking as completed        |
| POST   | `/:id/review`         | Farmer/Owner | Submit rating + review           |

### Payments — `/api/v1/payments`
| Method | Endpoint              | Access  | Description              |
|--------|-----------------------|---------|--------------------------|
| POST   | `/`                   | Farmer  | Initiate payment         |
| GET    | `/`                   | Private | Payment history          |
| PATCH  | `/:id/status`         | Admin   | Update payment status    |
| POST   | `/:id/refund`         | Admin   | Process refund           |

### Admin — `/api/v1/admin`
| Method | Endpoint                         | Access | Description              |
|--------|----------------------------------|--------|--------------------------|
| GET    | `/dashboard`                     | Admin  | Platform stats overview  |
| GET    | `/users`                         | Admin  | List all users           |
| PATCH  | `/users/:id`                     | Admin  | Modify user account      |
| GET    | `/analytics`                     | Admin  | Platform analytics       |
| GET    | `/logs`                          | Admin  | Audit logs               |
| PATCH  | `/bookings/:id/force-cancel`     | Admin  | Force cancel booking     |
| GET    | `/reports/financial`             | Admin  | Financial report         |

### ML Integration — `/api/v1/ml`
| Method | Endpoint              | Access       | Description                    |
|--------|-----------------------|--------------|--------------------------------|
| GET    | `/demand-prediction`  | Owner/Admin  | Demand forecast next N days    |
| GET    | `/recommendations`    | Farmer       | Personalized machine recs      |
| POST   | `/optimal-pricing`    | Owner/Admin  | Suggest optimal listing price  |
| GET    | `/churn-risk`         | Admin        | Farmer churn risk analysis     |

---

## 🔐 Authentication

All protected routes require:
```
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
```

Token refresh:
```json
POST /api/v1/auth/refresh-token
{ "refreshToken": "<refresh_token>" }
```

---

## 💰 Dynamic Pricing Engine

Pricing is calculated as:
```
finalAmount = (baseCharge × seasonalMultiplier × demandMultiplier
              + operatorCharge + fuelCharge + transportCharge)
              × (1 + taxRate) + securityDeposit
```

**Seasonal Multipliers:**
- Kharif season (Jun–Oct): 1.5× (peak)
- Rabi season (Nov–Mar): 1.2×
- Summer (Apr–May): 0.8× (off-season)

**Demand Multipliers:**
- 15+ recent bookings: 1.3×
- 8–14 bookings: 1.15×
- 3–7 bookings: 1.0×
- Under 3 bookings: 0.95× (attract bookings)

---

## 🔒 Security Features

- Bcrypt password hashing (12 rounds)
- Account lockout after 5 failed login attempts (2 hour lock)
- JWT access tokens (7d) + refresh tokens (30d)
- Password change invalidates all old tokens
- Helmet.js security headers
- CORS with whitelist
- Global + per-route rate limiting
- Input validation on all endpoints
- Activity audit logging to MongoDB

---

## 📊 Booking Workflow

```
Farmer submits → [PENDING]
                     ↓
Owner reviews → [CONFIRMED] or [REJECTED]
                     ↓
Machine delivered → [ACTIVE]
                     ↓
Work completed → [COMPLETED]
                     ↓
Both parties submit reviews
```

Auto-lifecycle (cron jobs):
- Auto-activate confirmed bookings when start date arrives
- Auto-complete active bookings when end date passes
- Auto-cancel pending bookings with no response after 48h

